# DreamMaker build output
*.dmb
*.rsc
*.dyn.rsc
*.int
*.lk
*.backup

# BYOND distributions. Each is ~23 MB of Byond Software's binaries and is not
# ours to redistribute. Fetch the builds you need and drop them in as
# byond-standalones/<version>/bin/. run.ps1 discovers them.
byond-standalones/

# Per-build scratch working directories created by run.ps1
build/

# Research material: third-party test cases and source artifacts backing
# VERIFICATION items. Not ours to publish; the findings they produce go into
# the public record, the artifacts themselves do not.
research/

# Transient run output. The suite writes results-<version>-<system>.tsv beside
# the .dmb; only curated copies under results/ are kept. Unanchored, so a stray
# is ignored wherever it lands rather than only at the root. Curated baselines
# are safe: they are named 516.1666-windows-merged.tsv, with no results- prefix.
results-*.tsv
/results.tsv
/results_del.tsv
*-out.txt

# Screen captures
*.mp4

# Editor and OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
